      },
      "natural_statement": "A bounded primary-source scope lookup read Hamilton 1982 III.1.1.3 and III.3.3.1, Kallen 1978 Lemma 3.3 in its Section 3 setting, and Gunther ICM 1990/1991 Theorem 1. No exact matching finite-input/no-free-map correction theorem was found there; this is not a literature-wide novelty claim. A Nash 1956 JSTOR passage was inaccessible and is not used. No external inverse theorem is an assumption of C_POLY_CORRECTION.",
      "formal_statement": "",
